Z||000000||Blondie88||10-04-2001||07:25 PM||||My dad, being a joker of all sorts was driving my 95 neon, with his 50 year old sister in the front seat and my uncle and I were in the back.  Anyways, this car pulls up blasting rap music, it was probably lowered 2 inches and there were 2 20 year olds in the car.  Dad started revving the engine and looking over at the other car just smiling and nodding him on.  They of course started laughing and revved their engine louder.  They blasted off at the green light, and we all busted up laughing up and kicked their ass in the long run.  He swerved in between trucks and ended up getting ahead of them by about 5 car lengths. The other car was by far faster, but  I think dad can maneuver any car real good....but I thought it was funny, not a fiero story but hey!||||reg||1
